{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 Welcome to the Jingle \u2014 VR Bowling, Holiday Chaos, and Elf Attitude!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re Santa. You bowl. The elves judge you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jingle Strike \u2014 VR Bowling</strong> combines <strong>true-feel bowling physics</strong> with <strong>absurd Christmas comedy</strong>. Every throw has real weight and spin, and every miss gets you roasted by a cast of animated elves who cheer, jeer, dance, argue, and occasionally\u2026 fart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bowl across <strong>four fully-themed festive lanes</strong>, each packed with lights, snow, mischief, and animated elf reactions. Smash a strike and they celebrate. Miss a pin and they <i>really</i> celebrate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when you\u2019re ready for something different, jump into <strong>85 Second Slam-Down</strong> \u2014 a high-speed, non-Christmas arcade mode built for pure bowling mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for parties, families, or anyone who loves <strong>VR bowling with personality</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/d3bf067ffa6c462ad78205274d5a14b4.avif?t=1766436510\" alt=\"Interactive lobby \" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras_big/d3bf067ffa6c462ad78205274d5a14b4.avif?t=1766436510 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf84 <strong>What\u2019s Inside</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf85 Five Festive VR Bowling Lanes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Santa\u2019s Workshop to Candy Cane Lane, each lane is full of life, charm, and elf chaos \u2014 with more lanes planned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/e682042464d98861527e8a0a4aa3b80d.avif?t=1766436510\" alt=\"From winter wonderland to hot summer beach\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras_big/e682042464d98861527e8a0a4aa3b80d.avif?t=1766436510 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb3 Realistic Bowling Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every roll has authentic weight, spin, and impact. If you hit a strike, you earned it \u2014 and the elves know it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/0064b5d7e23dc7831240d2d0e4228e1a.avif?t=1766436510\" alt=\"Real physics bowling\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras_big/0064b5d7e23dc7831240d2d0e4228e1a.avif?t=1766436510 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude02 Fully Reactive Elves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They cheer.<br>They roast you.<br>They dance.<br>They complain about loud music.<br>They want biscuits.<br>They fart.<br>They never repeat the same reaction twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/90b4e11336af8c5d0e7bad314eb8ea5e.avif?t=1766436510\" alt=\"Cheeky elves ready to roast you and sometimes compliment you\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras_big/90b4e11336af8c5d0e7bad314eb8ea5e.avif?t=1766436510 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 85 Second Slam-Down (Arcade Mode)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Christmas d\u00e9cor \u2014 just neon lights, fast resets, heart-pounding music, and pure skill-based VR bowling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/5f55f63a693dbaae36326a0aea34c4ae.avif?t=1766436510\" alt=\"85 Second Slam-Down Neon arcade bowling\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras_big/5f55f63a693dbaae36326a0aea34c4ae.avif?t=1766436510 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Leaderboards &amp; Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete globally for Top Bowler or Slam-Down Champion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcf8 Pin Cam</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic replays and hilarious elf animations for every strike, spare, and fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/1f7c56e0ff40cd7b5699c03affb3b483.avif?t=1766436510\" alt=\"Live pin cam with animations for Strikes and Spares\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras_big/1f7c56e0ff40cd7b5699c03affb3b483.avif?t=1766436510 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf81 Throwables &amp; Reactions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snowballs, gifts, pins \u2014 hurl them at elves and watch them react in ridiculous ways.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66 1\u20135 Player Couch VR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass the headset and bowl together. Great for holidays, parties, and after-dinner chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/3a6ac6bf79c218efe441f4967457ed92.avif?t=1766436510\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras_big/3a6ac6bf79c218efe441f4967457ed92.avif?t=1766436510 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf84 Family-Friendly Fun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Festive, funny, easy to play \u2014 no bowling shoes required.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The elves won\u2019t take bowling seriously\u2026 but you might.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Jingle Strike \u2014 VR Bowling</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3941080?t=1766436510","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/2da1ddf2fb2d353eae7dd8b8accd20f06f465cfc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766436510","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/6b1ca912b0c543bbc40c42b3b3281adfbe204592/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766436510","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/6b1ca912b0c543bbc40c42b3b3281adfbe204592/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766436510","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 Welcome to the Jingle \u2014 VR Bowling, Holiday Chaos, and Elf Attitude!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re Santa. You bowl. The elves judge you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jingle Strike \u2014 VR Bowling</strong> combines <strong>true-feel bowling physics</strong> with <strong>absurd Christmas comedy</strong>. Every throw has real weight and spin, and every miss gets you roasted by a cast of animated elves who cheer, jeer, dance, argue, and occasionally\u2026 fart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bowl across <strong>four fully-themed festive lanes</strong>, each packed with lights, snow, mischief, and animated elf reactions. Smash a strike and they celebrate. Miss a pin and they <i>really</i> celebrate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when you\u2019re ready for something different, jump into <strong>85 Second Slam-Down</strong> \u2014 a high-speed, non-Christmas arcade mode built for pure bowling mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for parties, families, or anyone who loves <strong>VR bowling with personality</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/d3bf067ffa6c462ad78205274d5a14b4.avif?t=1766436510\" alt=\"Interactive lobby \" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras_big/d3bf067ffa6c462ad78205274d5a14b4.avif?t=1766436510 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf84 <strong>What\u2019s Inside</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf85 Five Festive VR Bowling Lanes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Santa\u2019s Workshop to Candy Cane Lane, each lane is full of life, charm, and elf chaos \u2014 with more lanes planned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/e682042464d98861527e8a0a4aa3b80d.avif?t=1766436510\" alt=\"From winter wonderland to hot summer beach\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras_big/e682042464d98861527e8a0a4aa3b80d.avif?t=1766436510 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb3 Realistic Bowling Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every roll has authentic weight, spin, and impact. If you hit a strike, you earned it \u2014 and the elves know it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/0064b5d7e23dc7831240d2d0e4228e1a.avif?t=1766436510\" alt=\"Real physics bowling\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras_big/0064b5d7e23dc7831240d2d0e4228e1a.avif?t=1766436510 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude02 Fully Reactive Elves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They cheer.<br>They roast you.<br>They dance.<br>They complain about loud music.<br>They want biscuits.<br>They fart.<br>They never repeat the same reaction twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/90b4e11336af8c5d0e7bad314eb8ea5e.avif?t=1766436510\" alt=\"Cheeky elves ready to roast you and sometimes compliment you\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras_big/90b4e11336af8c5d0e7bad314eb8ea5e.avif?t=1766436510 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 85 Second Slam-Down (Arcade Mode)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Christmas d\u00e9cor \u2014 just neon lights, fast resets, heart-pounding music, and pure skill-based VR bowling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/5f55f63a693dbaae36326a0aea34c4ae.avif?t=1766436510\" alt=\"85 Second Slam-Down Neon arcade bowling\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras_big/5f55f63a693dbaae36326a0aea34c4ae.avif?t=1766436510 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Leaderboards &amp; Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete globally for Top Bowler or Slam-Down Champion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcf8 Pin Cam</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic replays and hilarious elf animations for every strike, spare, and fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/1f7c56e0ff40cd7b5699c03affb3b483.avif?t=1766436510\" alt=\"Live pin cam with animations for Strikes and Spares\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras_big/1f7c56e0ff40cd7b5699c03affb3b483.avif?t=1766436510 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf81 Throwables &amp; Reactions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snowballs, gifts, pins \u2014 hurl them at elves and watch them react in ridiculous ways.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66 1\u20135 Player Couch VR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass the headset and bowl together. Great for holidays, parties, and after-dinner chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras/3a6ac6bf79c218efe441f4967457ed92.avif?t=1766436510\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/extras_big/3a6ac6bf79c218efe441f4967457ed92.avif?t=1766436510 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf84 Family-Friendly Fun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Festive, funny, easy to play \u2014 no bowling shoes required.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The elves won\u2019t take bowling seriously\u2026 but you might.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Jingle Strike \u2014 VR Bowling</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Spooky Pictures Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/9463fc85ace7e2c565cb8b0da9f9473b7f2f45c1/header.jpg?t=1766436510","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Spooky Pictures. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3941080/2041969526/2f486d9c3a4c31a37cad9c3d05039167df9144d8/1763758783/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763759497","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3941080/2041969526/2f486d9c3a4c31a37cad9c3d05039167df9144d8/1763758783/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763759497","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3941080/2041969526/2f486d9c3a4c31a37cad9c3d05039167df9144d8/1763758783/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763759497","id":257201824,"name":"Available now on Steam","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257201824/9a83b07bcc106bc7969209bcf6b19bc897e539ca/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763759497"}],"name":"Jingle Strike VR Bowling","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":fals