a7c03e9fbb82fec209db0d8923c261e9cca1690/ss_0a7c03e9fbb82fec209db0d8923c261e9cca1690.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766436510","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/0a7c03e9fbb82fec209db0d8923c261e9cca1690/ss_0a7c03e9fbb82fec209db0d8923c261e9cca1690.600x338.jpg?t=1766436510"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/c132fda31a9f11c035f9c489c16c82355ebc5958/ss_c132fda31a9f11c035f9c489c16c82355ebc5958.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766436510","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/c132fda31a9f11c035f9c489c16c82355ebc5958/ss_c132fda31a9f11c035f9c489c16c82355ebc5958.600x338.jpg?t=1766436510"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/df4b949c4933276b7e6616fa413e5191e38cbd48/ss_df4b949c4933276b7e6616fa413e5191e38cbd48.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766436510","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941080/df4b949c4933276b7e6616fa413e5191e38cbd48/ss_df4b949c4933276b7e6616fa413e5191e38cbd48.600x338.jpg?t=1766436510"}],"short_description":"A hilarious VR bowling game where the elves roast every shot you take. Crush strikes with real-physics bowling across festive lanes, or get heckled when you miss. Fast, funny, family-friendly holiday chaos\u2014perfect for parties and VR newcomers.","steam_appid":3941080,"support_info":{"email":"hello@spookypictures.co.nz","url":"https://spookypicturesgames.co.nz/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://spookypicturesgames.co.nz/"}